  "decide-onboarding": {
   "x": 6240,
   "y": 15715,
   "w": 560,
   "maxH": 700,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "orange",
   "page": "review",
   "text": "Onboarding and the plan: yes or no to each?\n\ni · The plan is built by fixed rules on the phone: no account, no server, no AI call. Rules and six test plans are in design/plan-builder.\nj · Nine questions. Weight, height and sex are not asked.\nk · Your own v11 plan stays. Onboarding is for a new install and for \"Rebuild my plan\" in Settings.\nl · Swapping in exercises from the database replaces the spec line \"never suggest exercises that are not in the plan\".\n\nBoards 12.1 to 12.4 show the plan the rules build for your answers."
  },
  "decide-figures": {
